    "title": "Check For Understanding",
    "long_instructions": "\r\nA program is supposed to store a nickname. Two students test it: \r\n\r\n- Student A enters nothing and presses **Enter** --> `nickname = \"\"`\r\n- Student B enters a **space** and presses **Enter** --> `nickname = \" \"`\r\n\r\nAre `nickname` for Student A and Student B the same value? Explain how you know.\r\n",
